🚀 Week 7 – Day 2 Tools for Building LLM Applications 🛠️🤖

LangChain, LlamaIndex & OpenAI Tools

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 Introduction

Building LLM applications from scratch can be complex.

Popular frameworks simplify development by providing:

* Document loading
* Chunking
* Embeddings
* Retrieval
* Tool calling
* Agent workflows

The most widely used tools are:

* LangChain
* LlamaIndex
* OpenAI Tools (function/tool calling)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔗 1. LangChain

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 What is LangChain?

```text id="langchain_def"
A framework for building LLM-powered applications
```

---

🔹 Key Features

✔ Prompt templates
✔ Chains and pipelines
✔ Memory
✔ Agents
✔ Tool integration
✔ RAG support

---

🔹 Core Components

* Document Loaders
* Text Splitters
* Embedding Models
* Vector Stores
* Retrievers
* Chains
* Agents

---

💻 Example

```python id="langchain_example"
from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI

llm = ChatOpenAI(model="gpt-4")
response = llm.invoke("Explain RAG in simple terms")
print(response.content)
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📚 2. LlamaIndex

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 What is LlamaIndex?

```text id="llamaindex_def"
A framework for connecting private data to LLMs
```

---

🔹 Key Features

✔ Data ingestion
✔ Index creation
✔ Query engines
✔ RAG pipelines
✔ Document chat

---

💻 Example

```python id="llamaindex_example"
from llama_index.core import VectorStoreIndex, SimpleDirectoryReader

documents = SimpleDirectoryReader("data").load_data()
index = VectorStoreIndex.from_documents(documents)

query_engine = index.as_query_engine()
response = query_engine.query("Summarize the documents")
print(response)
```

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🛠️ 3. OpenAI Tools (Function Calling)

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 What are Tools?

```text id="tools_def"
Functions the model can call to perform external actions
```

---

🔹 Examples of Tool Usage

* Search database
* Fetch weather
* Query APIs
* Perform calculations

---

💻 Conceptual Example

```python id="tools_example"
tools = [
    {
        "type": "function",
        "function": {
            "name": "get_weather",
            "description": "Get current weather"
        }
    }
]
```

---

⚔️ LangChain vs LlamaIndex

| Feature        | LangChain        | LlamaIndex                    |
| -------------- | ---------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Focus          | General LLM apps | Data/RAG applications         |
| Agents         | Strong support   | Limited                       |
| RAG            | Excellent        | Excellent                     |
| Learning Curve | Moderate         | Easier for data-centric tasks |

---

🔗 How They Work Together

A common architecture:

```text id="combined_flow"
LlamaIndex (Data Layer) + LangChain (Workflow Layer) + OpenAI Tools (External Actions)
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🚀 Real-World Applications

✔ PDF chatbots
✔ Enterprise knowledge assistants
✔ AI agents
✔ Customer support systems
✔ Automated research tools

---

🧠 When to Use What?

✔ Use LangChain → Complex workflows and agents
✔ Use LlamaIndex → Document-centric RAG systems
✔ Use OpenAI Tools → Integrating APIs and functions

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📚 Key Takeaways

✔ LangChain builds end-to-end LLM applications
✔ LlamaIndex specializes in data ingestion and RAG
✔ OpenAI Tools enable function/tool calling
✔ These tools accelerate development of production AI systems


